From: Felipe Felix <felippe.felix98@gmail.com>
Subject: wayland: Implement org_kde_kwin_appmenu
 Chromium and Electron only export their menu bar over DBusMenu on Wayland
 when the compositor has the org_kde_kwin_appmenu_manager global. Implement
 the protocol and expose the menu's address on MetaWindow through the
 dbus-appmenu-service-name and dbus-appmenu-object-path properties.
Origin: other, https://github.com/felixefelip/mutter/tree/kde-appmenu
Forwarded: no
---
